   "title": "Why Data Cleaning Matters",
   "raw": "Why Data Cleaning Matters\n\n\n  Garbage In, Garbage Out\n  Even the most sophisticated analysis or model will produce misleading results if the input data is flawed.\n\n\n\n\n WITHOUT CLEANING                                         WITH PROPER CLEANING\n\n ✗ Incorrect conclusions from outliers                    ✓ Reliable statistical summaries\n ✗ Models that fail on edge cases                         ✓ Robust, generalizable models\n ✗ Visualizations that mislead                            ✓ Clear, honest visualizations\n ✗ Biased or unfair predictions                           ✓ Trustworthy insights\n\n\n\n\n Real talk: Data cleaning isn't glamorous, but it's where good data science is won or lost.\n                                                                                                               32",
