   "n": 36,
   "title": "Dealing with Outliers",
   "raw": "Dealing with Outliers\n\n\nHOW TO DETECT                                              WHAT TO DO\n\nVisual inspection                                            If error → Fix or remove\nBox plots, scatter plots, histograms                         Typos, data entry mistakes\n\nStatistical methods                                          If genuine → Keep or cap\nZ-score (>3), IQR method (1.5×IQR)                           Real extreme values — document decision\n\nDomain knowledge                                             Consider robust methods\nIs 999 min commute possible? Is -2 hrs sleep?                Median instead of mean, robust regression\n\n\n\n\n Key principle: Never blindly remove outliers. Investigate first — sometimes outliers are the most interesting data points!\n\n                                                                                                                       36",
