   "raw": "Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)\n\n EDA is the process of examining data to understand its structure, patterns, anomalies, and relationships\n before formal modeling. It's detective work for data.\n\n\n\n\n 📊                                         📈                                           🤔\n Summarize                                 Visualize                                   Question\n\n Mean, median, mode, standard deviation,   Histograms, box plots, scatter plots. See   What patterns exist? What's surprising?\n quartiles. Get the big picture numbers.   distributions and relationships.            What needs more investigation?\n\n\n\n\n EDA philosophy: Let the data speak first. Resist the urge to jump to conclusions before thoroughly exploring.\n                                                                                                                                 40",
