   "raw": "Choosing the Right Chart\n\n\n\n Histogram                                Box Plot                               Pie Chart\n Distribution of one numerical variable   Distribution + outliers + comparison   Parts of a whole (use sparingly!)\n e.g., sleep hours distribution           e.g., sleep by year level              e.g., device usage breakdown\n\n\n\n Bar Chart                                Scatter Plot                           Line Chart\n Comparing categories                     Relationship between two variables     Trends over time\n e.g., students per major                 e.g., commute vs study hours           e.g., survey responses over time\n\n\n\n\n  Rule of thumb: Choose based on what question you're answering, not what looks prettiest.\n\n                                                                                                                     46",
