   "raw": "What is a Foundation Model?\n\n   A foundation model is an AI system trained on massive amounts of data that can be adapted\n   to many different tasks. Examples include ChatGPT, Claude, and DeepSeek.\n\n\n\n\n  🔄                                          🎯                                          💬\n  Pre-trained                                General Purpose                            Conversational\n\n  Learned from billions of text examples     Can answer questions, write code,          Responds to natural language prompts\n  before you use it                          analyze data, and more                     in dialogue format\n\n\n\n\nIn this course: We can use DeepSeek as your Chief Teaching Assistant (CTA) to help you learn and work with data.\n                                                                                                                               50",
