   "title": "Prompt Engineering Principles",
   "raw": "Prompt Engineering Principles\nThe quality of AI output depends entirely on the quality of your input. Master these four principles.\n\n\n\n\n 1. Be Specific and Clear                                                3. Iterate and Refine\n Vague prompts produce vague answers. State exactly what you need,       First responses are starting points. Follow up, ask for clarification,\n including format, length, and scope.                                    request changes. Prompting is a conversation.\n\n\n 2. Provide Context                                                      4. Verify and Validate\n Share relevant background, constraints, and goals. The AI cannot read   Check outputs against known facts. Test code before using. You are\n your mind — tell it what it needs to know.                              responsible for the final product.\n\n\n\n\nRemember: The quality of your output is directly proportional to the quality of your input.                                                       55",
