   "title": "Effective Prompting Techniques",
   "raw": "Effective Prompting Techniques\n\n\n\n  CHAIN OF THOUGHT                           ROLE PROMPTING                           STRUCTURED OUTPUT\n\n  Ask the model to reason step by step       Assign the model a specific persona or   Request a specific format for the\n  before giving an answer.                   expertise level.                         response.\n\n   \"Think through this step by step before    \"Act as a senior data scientist          \"Respond in JSON format with fields\n   answering...\"                              reviewing this code...\"                  for...\"\n\n                                                                                      When: Data processing, APIs,\n  When: Math, logic, complex analysis        When: Code review, explanations,\n                                                                                      automation\n                                             feedback\n\n\n\n\nPro tip: These techniques dramatically improve response quality for complex tasks. Combine them as needed.                   56",
