   "title": "AI Ethics and Responsible Use",
   "raw": "AI Ethics and Responsible Use\n\n\n  ACADEMIC INTEGRITY                          BIAS AWARENESS                               TRANSPARENCY\n\n\n  AI helps you learn, but you must            Question data sources and check for fair     Be honest about how AI contributed to\n  understand your work.                       representation.                              your work.\n\n   ✓ Use AI to understand concepts              ✓ Consider who might be harmed              ✓ Acknowledge AI assistance\n\n\n\n   ✗ Submit AI output as your own work          ✗ Accept AI outputs uncritically            ✗ Hide your use of AI tools\n\n\n\n\nSimple rule: Can you explain and defend every part of your work? If not, you haven't learned it yet.\n                                                                                                                                   60",
