   "title": "Working with AI: Best Practices",
   "raw": "Working with AI: Best Practices\n\n\n  DO ✓                                                              DON'T ✗\n\n\n Use AI to understand concepts you're learning                     Submit AI-generated work as your own\n\n\n Ask for explanations of code or formulas                          Trust AI outputs without verification\n\n\n Verify all outputs against trusted sources                        Use AI as a shortcut to avoid learning\n\n\n Use AI to debug and learn from your mistakes                      Hide or misrepresent your AI usage\n\n\n\n\nRemember: AI is a learning tool, not a replacement for learning. You are responsible for your own understanding.\n                                                                                                                   61",
