   "n": 62,
   "title": "Critical Thinking with AI: The VERIFY Framework",
   "raw": "Critical Thinking with AI: The VERIFY Framework\nUse this framework every time you work with AI outputs to ensure quality and accuracy.\n\n\n\n V     Validate — Check facts against reliable sources. Don't trust claims without evidence.\n\n\n E     Execute — Run the code. Test the solution. See if it actually works as claimed.\n\n\n R     Reason — Does the logic make sense? Can you follow and explain the reasoning?\n\n\n  I    Inspect — Look for edge cases, potential errors, and things that might break.\n\n\n F     Fix — Iterate and improve. Use AI to help fix issues you identify.\n\n\n Y     Yours — Make it your own. Understand it well enough to explain and defend it.\n\n\n\n\nWe'll practice this framework throughout the course. It becomes second nature with repetition.\n                                                                                                 62",
